    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Both the rank six and rank seven forms have the shape of a butterfly. The rank seven form is much more dazzling, and on the butterfly’s body there is a change that looks like a tiny naked and pale person.",
        "chapters": [
          1680
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-seven-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When the cocoon breaks, a colorful butterfly flutters into the sky. Rainbow light rains down along its path and trails as a curvy rainbow behind it.",
        "chapters": [
          611
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "With the Immortal Gu in hand he treats time as recoverable hope even while cutting blessed land territory under tribulation pressure.",
        "chapters": [
          611
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later states that Immortal Gu Man as Before expends a lot of immortal essence.",
        "chapters": [
          615
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Unless it is a final resort, Gu Immortals do not readily use an Immortal Gu, since activating one costs immortal essence that is not easy to gather.",
        "chapters": [
          618
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Activation requires immortal essence; reviving an immortal is projected to cost a large number of green grape immortal essence beads.",
        "chapters": [
          636
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Even as Immortal Gu it only works on human bodies.",
        "chapters": [
          1431
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "During an earthly calamity’s wind flower and snow moon tribulation, Fang Yuan’s worsening injuries leave him no choice but to activate Man as Before, and its expenditure rapidly drains his already scarce immortal essence.",
        "chapters": [
          1098
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wind-flower-tribulation-activation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
