  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s Gu Immortal inheritance treats river as before, mountain as before, and Man as Before Gu as its core set, and theorizes advancing man as before to Immortal Gu during immortal ascension. The mortal Gu can be used only on others; Immortal Gu Man As Before can be used on oneself to extend lifespan.",
        "chapters": [
          604
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "gu_man_as_before_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Immortal zombie couple Shark Demon and Su Bai Man treat Tai Bai Yun Sheng with extreme courtesy because of the Man as Before Immortal Gu in his possession.",
        "chapters": [
          818
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "immortal-zombies-courtesy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_shark_demon",
          "char_su_bai_man"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In a completed trade with Sixth Hair, Fang Yuan obtains Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s Man as Before among a batch of Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_sixth_hair",
          "move_man_as_before"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later text states Landscape as Before and Man as Before belonged to Shadow Sect and reached Tai Bai Yun Sheng through Purple Mountain True Monarch.",
        "chapters": [
          1302
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_landscape_as_before",
          "fac_shadow_sect",
          "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan relies on rank six Man as Before as a main healing method and as a core of many Shadow Sect killer moves. Man as Before at rank six is weak against rank seven Gu Immortals and often fails; effect improves when the target is a time path Gu Immortal with many time path dao marks.",
        "chapters": [
          1441
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_time"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s main body later advances it from rank six to rank seven, and his time path clone oversees the refinement.",
        "chapters": [
          1680
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan judges that the backlash injuries from a failed attempt to improve the immortal killer move vajra shell, where he activated only a rank one mortal Gu, need no Man as Before, since his sovereign immortal body will heal them in a couple of days.",
        "chapters": [
          1314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "backlash-injuries",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
